{"name": "Too Deep To Quit", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"278\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/567822ac247b20192c4d0ff9be3001c7.poster.avif?t=1791531119\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/567822ac247b20192c4d0ff9be3001c7.webm?t=1791531119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/567822ac247b20192c4d0ff9be3001c7.mp4?t=1791531119\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Too Deep To Quit</strong> is a 1-4 player co-op survival exploration game. Gather your team of adventurers, brave the dangers of cursed temples, and claim the ultimate treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"83\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/d1c0772b7b1cc2c4946ea58fea9bd3cb.avif?t=1791531119\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"278\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/cbde07d5155d2cb67e61131932a956c2.poster.avif?t=1791531119\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/cbde07d5155d2cb67e61131932a956c2.webm?t=1791531119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/cbde07d5155d2cb67e61131932a956c2.mp4?t=1791531119\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A true adventurer knows how to improvise. These cursed temples hold a lot more than just gold, they\u2019re packed with the leftovers of the poor saps who came before you. Check every dark corner for whatever keeps you breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"83\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/a81c931ee64232efb85aaf490bfca7a5.avif?t=1791531119\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"278\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/fe1c7e2061a728ae83618c7f6d128ef1.poster.avif?t=1791531119\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/fe1c7e2061a728ae83618c7f6d128ef1.webm?t=1791531119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/fe1c7e2061a728ae83618c7f6d128ef1.mp4?t=1791531119\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sure, starving to death is bad, but getting squashed by the walls is definitely worse. Every hallway is a literal death trap waiting for the clumsy guy in your squad to mess up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"83\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/85994961aa516d1b0e369e65e561c963.avif?t=1791531119\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"278\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/2f0b9ab5af0df08f2e596d9507953b66.poster.avif?t=1791531119\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/2f0b9ab5af0df08f2e596d9507953b66.webm?t=1791531119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/2f0b9ab5af0df08f2e596d9507953b66.mp4?t=1791531119\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the traps don\u2019t get you, the locals will. These forgotten temples are the perfect breeding ground for anything that slithers, stings, or bites.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"83\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/a217414723493305c4d991fadc06415a.avif?t=1791531119\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"278\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/8d1e2c3c807a8965b90395f87211173c.poster.avif?t=1791531119\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/8d1e2c3c807a8965b90395f87211173c.webm?t=1791531119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/extras/8d1e2c3c807a8965b90395f87211173c.mp4?t=1791531119\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It belongs in a museum... but it\u2019ll look way better in your bank account. Deep within these ruins lie priceless artifacts and solid gold idols just waiting to be claimed.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Grab your gear and your friends for a hilarious, golden-age co-op adventure! Dive into cursed temples, hunt for the ultimate treasure, and work together to stay alive. Beware of everything and everyone... after all, only the survivors get to split the gold!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182190/5afabc0bdcc2efd0c69d745c291349460c1cffd2/header.jpg?t=1791531119", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Multiplayer", "Adventure", "Online Co-Op", "Physics", "Exploration", "Survival"], "developers": "Demon Max", "publishers": "Demon Max", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4182190", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "8 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/jy7Z_U7g6HA", "first_seen": 1791410400.0, "review_rank": 5}